RenPyLinter: synchronize scene layout with SDL display modes and logical size.
The scene-based app host does not receive UIApplication's deprecated status-bar
orientation notification. UIKit resize events must not be overwritten by cached
fullscreen-mode dimensions after SetWindowFullscreen returns.

